title: Max Hoelz
subtitle: The red general of the Vogtland is in Mansfeld, and answers to nobody.
view-if: crisis_march = 1 and e21_ma_hoelz = 0 and comrade_hoelz != 2 and comrade_hoelz != 3 and comrade_hoelz != 4
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Max Hoelz

Max Hoelz has come to Mansfeld with a few hundred armed men. [? if kapd_exists = 1 : We expelled him last year, and he is closer to the KAPD now than to us. ?] He blows up railway lines, robs banks and post offices to pay his fighters and burns the villas of the mine directors. The miners love him. The papers call him a bandit, and the police want him more than any man in Germany.

- @arms: Send him rifles and money.
- @discipline: Put his men under the strike committees.
- @border: Get him over the Czech border before they catch him.
- @disown: Disown him in the Rote Fahne.

@arms
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] His bands will hold the roads. Every bank he robs is in the next day's paper.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.e21_ma_hoelz = 1;
Q.e21_ma_out += 30;
Q.e21_ma_rift += 1;
RG.district('halle', {guards: 1, repression: 6});
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

A courier reaches Hoelz near Hettstedt with money and a cart of rifles. For a few days his bands and the miners' fighting groups act together, and they hold the roads.

@discipline
subtitle: Slower. The fighters will answer to someone, and their rifles go to the common stock.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_ma_hoelz = 2;
Q.e21_ma_out += 15;
Q.red_guards_arms += 5;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Hoelz agrees to work with the strike committees, more or less. He keeps his dynamite.

@border
subtitle: His men will go home. He will not stand trial, and he will not be back for a long time.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_ma_hoelz = 3;
Q.e21_ma_out = Math.max(20, Q.e21_ma_out - 10);
RG.exile('hoelz', {news: 'Max Hoelz escapes across the Czech border', priority: 2});
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Two comrades from Plauen take Hoelz over the Erzgebirge on foot, by paths the smugglers use. He is furious, and he goes. By the end of the week he is in Prague, and then on the way to Moscow.

@disown
subtitle: The strike stays clean, and a little smaller. The social democrats will notice.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_ma_hoelz = 4;
Q.e21_ma_out = Math.max(20, Q.e21_ma_out - 10);
Q.e21_ma_rift = Math.max(0, Q.e21_ma_rift - 1);
Q.spd_relation += 4;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

The Rote Fahne declares that bank robbery is not a communist method. Hoelz reads it, laughs, and carries on.
